WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Maria: Thanks everyone. Goal today is to agree on the launch plan for the website relaunch.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Tom: The design direction is approved. I need the final home page copy before I can finish the mockups.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:46.000
Maria: I can draft the copy this week. I will have a first version by Friday, 17 October.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.000
Priya: The redirect list is the risky part. We have about four hundred old URLs and nobody has exported them yet.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:37.000
Maria: Priya, please export the URL list and send it to me by Monday.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:21.000
Priya: Who signs off on the final copy? We still have not decided that.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:12.000
Tom: Launch date. Can we commit to 15 November?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:36.000
Maria: Let us call it a goal, not a commitment. It depends on copy sign-off.
